{"seq":2,"slug":"cargo-stability-securing-dangerous-goods","title":"货物稳定性与绑扎加固：堆码防倾倒、衬垫隔离与危险品 IMDG 隔离","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/container-loading-stowage-cartonization-optimization/weight-stability-stowage-mixed-cargo/cargo-stability-securing-dangerous-goods","wordCount":2935,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"货物稳定性与绑扎加固-堆码防倾倒-衬垫隔离与危险品-imdg-隔离\">货物稳定性与绑扎加固：堆码防倾倒、衬垫隔离与危险品 IMDG 隔离</h1><p>求解器给出一个几何上可行的装载方案：每个箱子都在柜内、没有重叠、总重不超限。柜门关上，船开出去，第二天在堆场发现最上层两排货整体前移了半米，把柜门顶变形。几何可行性不等于物理稳定性——货在运输中要承受纵向加减速、横向摇摆、垂向颠簸三组动载荷，任何一组超过约束，货物就滑移、倾倒或塌堆。本文处理装载方案交付前最后一道工程检查：<strong>货与柜之间、货与货之间的力是否被正确约束</strong>。它是同章 <a href=\"../loading-problem-packaging-data-model/stackability-physical-attribute-modeling\">可堆叠性与物理属性建模</a> 的下游：前者管&quot;能不能压&quot;，本文管&quot;会不会动&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-稳定性是三种失稳模式的力平衡\">核心概念：稳定性是三种失稳模式的力平衡</h2><p>货物在运输单元里失稳，只有三种基本形态，每种对应一个可判定的不等式。把它们写成约束，稳定性检查就从&quot;装柜师傅的经验&quot;变成可自动化的可行性判据：<strong>滑移</strong>是切向力超过摩擦与绑扎力的合力；<strong>倾倒</strong>是绕底边翻转的倾覆力矩超过稳定力矩；<strong>塌堆</strong>是层间承压超过下方箱体的允许载荷。前两种由货与柜的相互作用决定，第三种由前一章的可堆叠性约束接管。</p>\n<p>国际层面有两份文件界定这些约束的边界：IMO/ILO/UNECE 联合发布的 <strong>《货物运输单元装载操作规则》（CTU Code，2014 年通过，IMO 通函 MSC.1/Circ.1497）</strong> 是集装箱与公路运输单元内货物系固的通用实践准则；IMO 的 <strong>《货物积载与系固安全操作规则》（CSS Code，决议 A.714(17)）</strong> 及其附件 13 专门规范集装箱内货物系固。CTU Code 不是强制公约，但被 SOLAS 引用，并被大量船公司、货代和保险条款写进合同。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;动载荷&lt;br/&gt;纵向/横向/垂向加速度&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;滑移: F_t &gt; μ·N + Σ lashing&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; C[&quot;倾倒: M_tip &gt; M_stable&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; D[&quot;塌堆: Σw_above &gt; P_allow&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; E[&quot;绑扎 / 衬垫 / 摩擦垫&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; E&#10;  C --&gt; F[&quot;降低重心 / 增大底宽&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; G[&quot;堆叠上限 / 分层隔板&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; H[&quot;稳定装载方案&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[&quot;另需查 IMDG 隔离&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"动载荷&lt;br/&gt;纵向/横向/垂向加速度\"] --&gt; B[\"滑移: F_t &gt; μ·N + Σ lashing\"]\n  A --&gt; C[\"倾倒: M_tip &gt; M_stable\"]\n  A --&gt; D[\"塌堆: Σw_above &gt; P_allow\"]\n  B --&gt; E[\"绑扎 / 衬垫 / 摩擦垫\"]\n  C --&gt; E\n  C --&gt; F[\"降低重心 / 增大底宽\"]\n  D --&gt; G[\"堆叠上限 / 分层隔板\"]\n  E --&gt; H[\"稳定装载方案\"]\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[\"另需查 IMDG 隔离\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失稳模式</th>\n<th>支配量</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>主要对策</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>滑移</td>\n<td>摩擦系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>、绑扎水平分力</td>\n<td>切向合力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span></span></span></span></span> 摩擦持力</td>\n<td>摩擦垫、绑扎、楔块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>倾倒</td>\n<td>底宽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>、重心高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>加速度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a &gt; (b/h)\\,g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>降重心、加宽底、压顶绑扎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>塌堆</td>\n<td>承压强度、层数</td>\n<td>上方总重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span></span></span></span></span> 允许载荷</td>\n<td>限制层数、隔板、重下轻上</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"滑移与倾倒的力学判据\">滑移与倾倒的力学判据</h2><p>滑移的判据是经典的库仑摩擦平衡。货物受水平向动载荷 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F = m a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ma</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 为设计加速度），柜底面提供法向力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = m g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>，可用的摩擦持力为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，绑扎提供额外约束。水平方向平衡要求</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mtext>lash</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∥</mo></msubsup><mtext>  </mtext><mo>≥</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>⟹</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mtext>lash</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∥</mo></msubsup><mtext>  </mtext><mo>≥</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>m</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu\\, m g + \\sum_i F_{\\text{lash},i}^{\\parallel} \\;\\ge\\; m a \\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad \\sum_i F_{\\text{lash},i}^{\\parallel} \\;\\ge\\; m\\,(a - \\mu g)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lash</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∥</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4374em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.549em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ma</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟹</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lash</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∥</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4374em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">μg</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这条式子说明两件事。其一，<strong>摩擦是第一位约束</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu = 0.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span></span></span></span></span>（木箱在钢质柜底面的常见量级）与公路设计加速度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.8</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a = 0.8g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>（<strong>EN 12195-1:2010</strong> 对道路车辆前向载荷的规定值），括号内为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>，即摩擦只能吸收约四成前向载荷，剩下六成必须由绑扎承担。其二，<strong>摩擦系数是必须实测或选定的输入</strong>，用防滑垫（anti-slip matting）可把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 提升到 0.6 量级，直接砍掉近半绑扎需求。CTU Code 与 CSS Code 都附有典型接触面的摩擦系数取值表，应作为可选属性而非硬编码常量。</p>\n<p>倾倒的判据更简单，它是一个纯几何比值。货物绕底边前缘翻转，倾覆力矩来自水平加速度（力臂为重心高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>），稳定力矩来自重力（力臂为底宽之半 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span>），临界条件为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>h</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>≥</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>⟹</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>a</mi><mtext>tip</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m a \\cdot h \\;\\ge\\; m g \\cdot \\frac{b}{2} \\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad a_{\\text{tip}} = \\frac{b}{2h}\\,g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ma</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟹</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tip</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>高瘦货物的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b/(2h)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 很小，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mtext>tip</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_{\\text{tip}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tip</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 很容易被航行摇摆或急刹突破。竖直绑扎（下压绑扎）通过增加有效法向力同时提升摩擦持力和稳定力矩，是同时改善滑移与倾倒的少数手段之一；代价是它必须持续张紧，松弛后失效。因此<strong>设计加速度的选择是业务输入</strong>：EN 12195-1 与国内公路运输标准对不同方向给出不同量级，海运则须参考船级社与 CSS Code 附件 13 的加速度包络——用错方向或量级，绑扎量会差一倍以上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"绑扎与衬垫-msl-角度效率与-dunnage-选型\">绑扎与衬垫：MSL、角度效率与 dunnage 选型</h2><p>绑扎件能提供的力有一个法定上限 <strong>MSL（Maximum Securing Load，最大系固负荷）</strong>，它不等于破断强度。<strong>EN 12195-2</strong>（道路车辆束缚用织带）规定织带 MSL 取破断强度的 50%，CSS Code 对链条取 50%、钢丝绳取 80%。这个折减是安全系数，直接决定&quot;一条带子能算多少力&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>系固件</th>\n<th>MSL 相对破断强度</th>\n<th>典型破断强度量级</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>涤纶织带</td>\n<td>50%</td>\n<td>25–50 kN</td>\n<td>有弹性，需复紧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>链条</td>\n<td>50%</td>\n<td>40–120 kN</td>\n<td>刚性，不吸收冲击</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>钢丝绳</td>\n<td>80%</td>\n<td>视直径而定</td>\n<td>刚性，防剪切</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可充气气袋</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>按充气压力计</td>\n<td>填充空隙，非承拉</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>绑扎角度决定效率。一条与水平面成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 角的绑扎，其水平分力（抗滑移）为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F\\cos\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>，竖直分力（增加摩擦与抗倾倒）为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F\\sin\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>。忽略角度几何时用完整 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 计算，会系统性高估抗滑移能力——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha = 30°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30°</span></span></span></span></span> 时水平效率仅 0.87。更关键的是<strong>锚点位置</strong>：若绑扎两端都固定在柜底同一侧，它几乎不提供抗倾倒力矩，必须让绑扎跨过货物顶点才能起作用。</p>\n<p>衬垫（dunnage）填的是另一个维度——<strong>空隙</strong>。货物之间、货物与柜壁之间的空隙是滑移的温床：货物先要移动一段距离才接触约束。衬垫选型分三类：木质衬垫（木方、木条，靠钉接与抵靠形成刚性阻挡，即 blocking/bracing）、可充气气袋（在空隙中充气形成面接触）、摩擦垫与分隔板（提升 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 或分隔不同货物）。木质衬垫的尺寸与钉接方式、气袋的充气压力与接触面积，CTU Code 与 CSS Code 均有实践准则。<strong>关键纪律是&quot;先固定、再堆叠&quot;</strong>：一层货若在装下一层之前未被阻挡，后续堆叠只会把空隙压实。</p>\n<h2 id=\"imdg-危险品隔离-从隔离表到集装箱内距离\">IMDG 危险品隔离：从隔离表到集装箱内距离</h2><p>危险品的堆码与隔离走的是完全独立、且带法律强制力的体系。海运落地规则是 IMO 的 <strong>《国际海运危险货物规则》（IMDG Code）</strong>，2026 年在行的是 <strong>第 42-24 修正案</strong>（2024 年通过，2026 年 1 月 1 日起强制）。装载系统最关心的是 <strong>第 7.2 节隔离表（Segregation Table）</strong>，它把两个危险品类别的关系编码为四级，装载时必须把抽象级别翻译成柜内几何：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>隔离代号</th>\n<th>海上含义（7.2）</th>\n<th>同一集装箱内的落地判定</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1 — Away from（远离）</td>\n<td>可同舱，但须有效隔离</td>\n<td>水平距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 — Separated from（隔离）</td>\n<td>不同舱室，或甲板上下</td>\n<td>水平距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge 6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 — Separated by a complete compartment（隔一完整舱室）</td>\n<td>须隔舱</td>\n<td>不得同柜，须分装不同 CTU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4 — Separated longitudinally by an intervening complete compartment（纵向隔舱）</td>\n<td>纵向拉开完整舱</td>\n<td>不得同柜，且须纵向间隔</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>除类别对类别，&quot;远离&quot;与&quot;隔离&quot;在柜内的距离判据是装载算法可直接消费的不等式；代号 3、4 则升级为<strong>跨集装箱约束</strong>，会改变拼箱与配柜策略。此外还有一条常被忽略的约束：<strong>危险品与食品、饲料、生活用品不得同柜</strong>（IMDG 7.2 相关条款及各国卫生法规），它不来自隔离表，而来自污染风险，须作为独立规则编码。</p>\n<p>两个高危细节必须进模型。其一是<strong>第 1 类爆炸品</strong>：它们之间还要按<strong>兼容性组字母 A–S</strong> 判定能否同装，同属第 1 类但组别不兼容的两票货，即便隔离表标&quot;远离&quot;也不可同柜。其二是<strong>锂电池</strong>：需通过 <strong>UN 38.3</strong> 测试，按 IMDG 特殊规定 188 可豁免为&quot;非危险品&quot;运输（前提是荷电状态、包装、标记合规），但<strong>损坏或有缺陷的电芯（特殊规定 376）</strong> 被列为高危，应默认拒绝自动配载并转人工。携带锂电池的设备（UN3481）与独立锂电芯（UN3480）的隔离与积载要求并不相同，字段必须区分 UN 编号而非只存&quot;锂电池&quot;标签。</p>\n<h2 id=\"装载系统里的实现-约束-校验与失效模式\">装载系统里的实现：约束、校验与失效模式</h2><p>稳定性与隔离约束在系统里应落成两张可校验表和一组入库校验，而不是散落在求解器里的 if 分支。第一张是 <strong>成对隔离矩阵</strong> <code>segregation[classA][classB] -&gt; {level, minDistanceM, sameCTUAllowed}</code>，由 IMDG 7.2 表离线生成，装载时按柜内坐标直接判定距离；第二张是 <strong>系固需求表</strong> <code>securing(accel, mu, cargoMass) -&gt; requiredLashForce</code>，由滑移判据计算，再与所选绑扎件的 MSL 折算结果比对。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;货主申报: UN 编号/类别/包装组&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;成对隔离矩阵查询&quot;]&#10;  C[&quot;物理属性: 质量/重心/底面尺寸&quot;] --&gt; D[&quot;滑移/倾倒判据&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; E{sameCTUAllowed?}&#10;  E -- 否 --&gt; F[&quot;拒绝自动配柜&lt;br/&gt;转人工/分柜&quot;]&#10;  E -- 是 --&gt; G[&quot;校验柜内距离 &gt;= minDistanceM&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; H{requiredLashForce &lt;= totalMSL?}&#10;  H -- 否 --&gt; I[&quot;增加绑扎/衬垫&lt;br/&gt;或降重心重排&quot;]&#10;  H -- 是 --&gt; J[&quot;输出方案 + 系固清单&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; J&#10;  F --&gt; J\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"货主申报: UN 编号/类别/包装组\"] --&gt; B[\"成对隔离矩阵查询\"]\n  C[\"物理属性: 质量/重心/底面尺寸\"] --&gt; D[\"滑移/倾倒判据\"]\n  B --&gt; E{sameCTUAllowed?}\n  E -- 否 --&gt; F[\"拒绝自动配柜&lt;br/&gt;转人工/分柜\"]\n  E -- 是 --&gt; G[\"校验柜内距离 &gt;= minDistanceM\"]\n  D --&gt; H{requiredLashForce &lt;= totalMSL?}\n  H -- 否 --&gt; I[\"增加绑扎/衬垫&lt;br/&gt;或降重心重排\"]\n  H -- 是 --&gt; J[\"输出方案 + 系固清单\"]\n  G --&gt; J\n  F --&gt; J</pre><p>入库校验与求解器贯通的三条规则：<code>hazmat.class</code> 存在时 <code>unNumber</code> 与 <code>packingGroup</code> 必填；<code>segregationGroup</code>（爆炸品兼容性组）仅在 class=1 时必填但一旦出现即参与判定；系固需求计算所需的 <code>mu</code>、<code>accel</code>、重心坐标缺一即回退到<strong>保守默认</strong>（取最不利加速度与最低摩擦系数）。</p>\n<p>三类失效模式值得显式记录，它们都不会出现在求解器日志里：<strong>几何可行被误当物理稳定</strong>（求出无重叠方案即放行，跳过滑移/倾倒检查）；<strong>MSL 被当成破断强度</strong>（实际可承载只有一半，安全裕度被高估一倍）；<strong>隔离距离单位或坐标系错位</strong>（用箱位序号而非米，或把柜内纵向与横向记反）。共同特征是&quot;正确的算法 + 错误的物理输入或假设&quot;，与前一章 <a href=\"../loading-problem-packaging-data-model/stackability-physical-attribute-modeling\">可堆叠性与物理属性建模</a> 的结论一致：物理约束建模的本质是数据治理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>货物稳定性与危险品隔离是装载方案出厂前的最后一道物理闸门，它把&quot;几何可行&quot;升级为&quot;物理可行&quot;。要点如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>三种失稳模式各有判据</strong>：滑移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∥</mo></msub><mo>≥</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum F_{\\parallel} \\ge m(a-\\mu g)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1052em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∥</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">μg</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、倾倒 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mtext>tip</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_{\\text{tip}} = b\\,g/(2h)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tip</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、塌堆 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>above</mtext></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>allow</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum w_{\\text{above}} \\le P_{\\text{allow}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">above</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">allow</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；前两者由绑扎与衬垫化解，第三者由可堆叠性约束接管。</li>\n<li><strong>绑扎能力以 MSL 计价</strong>，织带与链条取破断强度 50%、钢丝绳 80%（EN 12195-2 / CSS Code）；忽略角度效率与锚点几何会系统性高估抗滑移与抗倾倒能力。</li>\n<li><strong>衬垫填的是空隙</strong>，木质阻挡、气袋填充、摩擦垫提升 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 三路并行，纪律是&quot;先固定再堆叠&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>危险品走 IMDG 第 7.2 节四级隔离</strong>，在柜内翻译为 3 m / 6 m 距离或跨柜约束；爆炸品兼容性组与锂电池 UN 38.3 是 2026 年的两个高危细节。</li>\n<li><strong>实现上落成两张可校验表</strong>：成对隔离矩阵与系固需求表；缺省值一律取最不利，因为&quot;缺数据被当成允许&quot;是这类系统最危险的失效模式。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>约束边界由 <strong>CTU Code（MSC.1/Circ.1497）</strong>、<strong>CSS Code（A.714(17)）</strong>、<strong>EN 12195 系列</strong>、<strong>IMDG Code（第 42-24 修正案）</strong> 与 <strong>ISO 1496-1</strong> 共同界定；它们不是可选参考，而是装载方案能否被判为合规的判据来源。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"货物稳定性与绑扎加固：堆码防倾倒、衬垫隔离与危险品 IMDG 隔离","id":"货物稳定性与绑扎加固-堆码防倾倒-衬垫隔离与危险品-imdg-隔离"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：稳定性是三种失稳模式的力平衡","id":"核心概念-稳定性是三种失稳模式的力平衡"},{"level":2,"text":"滑移与倾倒的力学判据","id":"滑移与倾倒的力学判据"},{"level":2,"text":"绑扎与衬垫：MSL、角度效率与 dunnage 选型","id":"绑扎与衬垫-msl-角度效率与-dunnage-选型"},{"level":2,"text":"IMDG 危险品隔离：从隔离表到集装箱内距离","id":"imdg-危险品隔离-从隔离表到集装箱内距离"},{"level":2,"text":"装载系统里的实现：约束、校验与失效模式","id":"装载系统里的实现-约束-校验与失效模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"集装箱重量配平：重心高度、偏载轴重与 VGM 申报合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/container-loading-stowage-cartonization-optimization/weight-stability-stowage-mixed-cargo/container-weight-balance-vgm"},"next":{"title":"混装积载与多目的地卸货顺序：LIFO 分层与 floor loading 策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/container-loading-stowage-cartonization-optimization/weight-stability-stowage-mixed-cargo/mixed-cargo-stowage-discharge-sequence"}}